        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer LB1002-400, 4\" x 4\" x 1/4\" Radius Full Surface Single Acting Spring Hinges</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer Lavatory Door Spring Hinges are packaged complete with a one (1) Single Action Spring Door Hinges, 2 Backplates, <a href=\"/products/spring-hinge-locking-pins-and-tension-tool-bommer-f87464-0910\">Tension Adjusting Tool and Locking Pin</a> plus brass threaded rod and barrel nuts. Thru-bolt mounted - The threaded rod is field sized for your door thickness. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese full surface spring hinges are normally used on restroom stall doors. Full Surface Hinge - Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. Door flange is surface applied to door face. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for Bommer LB1002-400 Lavatory Door Spring Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 1/4\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .109 </li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Full Surface</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LB1002-400.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer LB1002-400 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAvailable with or with out Hold Open option (Holds door in open position).\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/single-action-spring-hinges\">Spring Hinges</a>.\r\n<br><br></b>\r\n</p>",
